The songs for Radiohead's album _Hail to the Thief_ were developed amidst certain conditions.

_Hail to the Thief (Live Recordings 2003-2009)_ is Radiohead's a certain type of album.

Someone revisited these live recordings while preparing for _Hamlet Hail to the Thief_. 
The songs for Radiohead's album _Hail to the Thief_ were developed amidst televised war, tabloid sleaze, hawkish warmongers, and mass hysteria.

