<accept> The text explicitly states: "Twentyish years ago, the band honed these songs in the shadow of a swelling wave of global fascism, squirming in the center of a burgeoning digital panopticon, experiencing the thousand unnatural shocks of televised war, tabloid sleaze, hawkish warmongers, and mass hysteria." This directly confirms the claim that the songs for _Hail to the Thief_ were developed amidst these conditions. </accept>

