<accept> The content explicitly states, "Welcome, then, _Hail to the Thief (Live Recordings 2003-2009)_, Radiohead’s second-ever live album. (The first was 2001’s _I Might Be Wrong_, featuring songs from _Kid A_ and _Amnesiac_)." </accept>

